msgid ""
"This will WIPE the current Products tab in Google Sheets and then re-push "
"every product from scratch. Any rows you added manually to that tab will be "
"lost. Continue?"
msgstr ""
"Dadurch wird die aktuelle Produkte-Registerkarte in Google Sheets GELÖSCHT "
